   ["Rock slider", "1.75 in DOM steel tube, optional top plate (Cali Raised)", "Frame, bolt-on with five mounting legs", "Maker says frame-mounted sliders can support the vehicle's weight", "Best; built to take impacts", "Not covered in the site's guides; slider-style steps about $200–$280", "Trail use, rocker protection"],
